lose\" onclick=\"addMyON();\" ><i class=\"fal fa-folder-open\"></i> MyON담기</button></li>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<li><button type=\"button\" onclick=\"doiLinkOpen('http://data.doi.or.kr/cite/10.9766/kimst.2012.15.6.746');\" class=\"like-alink modal-open-close\" data-kisti-modal=\"#doiQuotationStyle\"><i class=\"fal fa-quote-left\"></i> 인용</button></li>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<!-- AI Review 담기 -->\r\n\t\t<a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" onclick=\"checkSaveAIReviewArticle('JAKO201213660554224',this); return false;\" class=\"btn-versatile ai-helper flex-start ai-review-add-\"><span class=\"icoimg\"><img src=\"/newUI/img/aihelper/ico_aireviewer_s2.png\" alt=\"AI-Reviewer 아이콘\"></span>&nbsp;<em>AI-Reviewer</em></a>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"right-con sns-link flex-end\">\r\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" onclick=\"snsOpen('facebook', '[논문]헬리콥터 오토로테이션시 착륙장치 거동에 관한 연구');\" class=\"sns-link-btn\"><img src=\"/newUI/img/common/ico_social_facebook.png\" alt=\"페이스북 공유\" /></button>\r\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" onclick=\"snsOpen('twitter', '[논문]헬리콥터 오토로테이션시 착륙장치 거동에 관한 연구');\" class=\"sns-link-btn\"><img src=\"/newUI/img/common/ico_social_x.png\" alt=\"트위터 공유\" /></button>\r\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" onclick=\"shareKakao('[논문]헬리콥터 오토로테이션시 착륙장치 거동에 관한 연구');\" class=\"sns-link-btn\"><img src=\"/newUI/img/common/ico_social_kakao.png\" alt=\"카카오 공유\" /></button>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</aside>\r\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"hidden fnAddMyon\" checked=\"checked\" name=\"scrapChkBox\" id=\"scrap\" value=\"JAKO201213660554224\" data-infracd=\"DATA\" data-tapcode=\"ARTI\"\r\n\t\t   data-title=\"[논문]헬리콥터 오토로테이션시 착륙장치 거동에 관한 연구\" data-infrano=\"JAKO201213660554224\" title=\"[논문]헬리콥터 오토로테이션시 착륙장치 거동에 관한 연구 선택\"/>\r\n\t\t<!-- 초록, Abstract, 주제어 { -->\r\n\t\t<section class=\"search-detail-box no-top-line\" id=\"sect_abs\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h3 class=\"sd-tit-h3 flex-start mgt40px\">\r\n\t\t<b>Abstract</b>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<span id=\"arrow_e\" class=\"expand\" onclick=\"javascript:fn_more(this); return false;\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\">▼</span>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"flex-start btns hover-btn-blue-line ai-helper-btn\" abid=\"aihelper-abstract-e\" data-bhvr-no=\"855\" data-evnt-no=\"01\" data-log-no=\"202510233050070588\" data-url-no=\"PG023\" data-cn=\"JAKO201213660554224\"><span class=\"icoimg\"><img src=\"/newUI/img/ico_aihelper_m.svg\" alt=\"AI-Helper 아이콘\"></span><em>AI-Helper</em></a>\r\n\t\t</h3>\r\n\t\t<p class=\"font-weight-light abstract-e\">ROK military helicopters are frequently exposed to the hazard situations due to the characteristic of operation. Especially, helicopter accident may lead to critical damage of human and structure. Accordingly, pilots have to train the autorotation procedures and learn the skill to prevent hard landi...</p>\r\n\t\t<p class=\"font-weight-light abstract-e hidden\" id=\"aihelper-abstract-e\">ROK military helicopters are frequently exposed to the hazard situations due to the characteristic of operation. Especially, helicopter accident may lead to critical damage of human and structure. Accordingly, pilots have to train the autorotation procedures and learn the skill to prevent hard landing. In this paper, the behavior of skid gear subject to the helicopter autorotation was conducted by using numerical method. The computer simulation approach by using finite element method was employed to accomplish this goal. Additionally, the behavior of skid gear was evaluated for the different landing conditions. In conclusion, the maximum stress concentration was occurred at the attached area of skid cross-tube to the fuselage. Also, it was revealed that the most proper attitude was level landing to prevent hard landing.</p>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"abe_fulltext hidden\" id=\"aihelper-abstract-e\">ROK military helicopters are frequently exposed to the hazard situations due to the characteristic of operation. Especially, helicopter accident may lead to critical damage of human and structure. Accordingly, pilots have to train the autorotation procedures and learn the skill to prevent hard landing. In this paper, the behavior of skid gear subject to the helicopter autorotation was conducted by using numerical method. The computer simulation approach by using finite element method was employed to accomplish this goal. Additionally, the behavior of skid gear was evaluated for the different landing conditions. In conclusion, the maximum stress concentration was occurred at the attached area of skid cross-tube to the fuselage. Also, it was revealed that the most proper attitude was level landing to prevent hard landing.</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<h3 class=\"sd-tit-h3 mgt40px\"><b>Keyword</b></h3>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"tag-list flex-start\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<a href=\"#;\" class=\"tag-btn\" onclick=\"searchTag('유한요소법');return false;\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n\t\t#유한요소법\r\n\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<a href=\"#;\" class=\"tag-btn\" onclick=\"searchTag('오토로테이션');return false;\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n\t\t#오토로테이션\r\n\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<a href=\"#;\" class=\"tag-btn\" onclick=\"searchTag('하드랜딩');return false;\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n\t\t#하드랜딩\r\n\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<a href=\"#;\" class=\"tag-btn\" onclick=\"searchTag('스키드기어');return false;\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n\t\t#스키드기어\r\n\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<!-- } 초록, Abstract, 주제어 -->\r\n\r\n\t\t<!-- 표/그림 { -->\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<!-- } 표/그림 -->\r\n\t\t<!-- AI 본문요약 { -->\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t